    '4. 本軟體提供的音訊離線匯出（WAV）功能僅用於您對允許試聽的內容進行學習、研究或音效調試，匯出的檔案不得用於任何侵權、商業或公開傳播用途。本軟體已在您每次匯出前透過醒目的彈窗與倒數計時提示向您充分告知上述限制；如您仍將匯出的音訊檔案上傳、傳播、分發或用於任何商業用途，該等行為係您本人的操作與選擇，所產生的全部法律責任由您自行承擔，與開發者無關。',
    '4. The WAV offline export feature of the Software is for your personal study, research, or audio tuning of content you are permitted to preview. Exported files may not be used for any infringing, commercial, or public distribution purposes. The Software has fully informed you of the above restrictions via prominent pop-ups and countdown notices before each export. If you still upload, distribute, or use exported audio files commercially, such acts are your own operations and choices, and you bear all resulting legal liability; the developer is not involved.',
